e qui révélera un lourd secret d’État. Il va croiser la route de Lépine, de retour à la tête d’une Préfecture vérolée par les luttes de pouvoir, de la première femme avocate et d’une courtisane reconvertie en espionne... Ces personnages que tout oppose vont s’unir pour affronter un coup d’état. La Belle Époque n’a de belle que le nom.","tagline":"Lumière sur une époque noire."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iCl2MARtzmlCCsqWrRxxUXv14fM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sQONcmwvfYrOeEo4fx5GN3lh4N7.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wa6B0ohjqDvZNO49yWkHFduD6P3.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93911/season/1"}],"schema":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TVSeries","dateCreated":"2019-09-21T18:09:13Z","dateModified":"2025-05-20T22:51:02Z","description":"Parigi, Francia, 1899. Il cadavere di una donna sconosciuta viene ritrovato nella Senna. L'indagine spingerà un giovane ispettore ambizioso a scoprire un pesante segreto di Stato.","isFamilyFriendly":true,"name":"Paris Police 1900","numberOfEpisodes":8,"url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93911-paris-police-1900","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","bestRating":10,"ratingValue":6.6,"ratingCount":56,"worstRating":0},"countryOfOrigin":[{"@type":"Country","name":"Francia"}],"endDate":"2021-03-01T00:00:00Z","genre":["Dramma","Crime"],"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCl2MARtzmlCCsqWrRxxUXv14fM.jpg","startDate":"2021-02-08T00:00:00Z","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Evelyne Brochu","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/461309-evelyne-brochu"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Jérémie Laheurte","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1618429-jeremie-laheurte"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Eugénie Derouand","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1850235-eug